{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117225841621-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117231105\"/><p>秀茂坪發生虐畜案。今午(17日)5時02分，樂華(北)邨勤華樓保安員報案，指在大廈平台發現一貓隻屍體，懷疑牠從高處墮下。警員接報到場經初步調查後，案件列作「殘酷對待動物」跟進，暫未有人被捕。相關貓屍體由愛協人員檢走。據了解，該貓為緬因貓，已經成年，身長約60厘米及屬於雌性。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:56:20.689805+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:58:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:43.195637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:43.195637+00:00","content_hash":"cddb6a4c59bfd724dd0410a5a7b0eb65d686ea1b0231ec58cc395dee1f334857","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}